            <div xml:id="d396">

                <pb facs="0778" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg658"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.415/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-02-18T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>15. Brazilian Ambassador, by instructions, invites this Government to attend
                    Centennial Celebration September next at Rio de Janeiro.</p>
                <p>Cable whether this is distinct from Exposition, if so, advising Department fully
                    regarding it and of action you recommend.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
